  "goal": "Materialize a shared, derived, non-authoritative and rebuildable Change-History Intelligence Fabric under FA3-JOURNAL-001 that explains what changed, why, what it affects, which evidence and decisions support it, what became stale, and what rollback/requalification is required without replacing Journal, Canonical Registry, Evidence, License & Rights, Current Host, release or approval authorities.",
